message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."

title: "HFZ-Poland-2025: Reproducible analysis code"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Firek"
    given-names: "Wiesław"

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-30

repository-code: "https://github.com/wieslawfirek/HFZ-Poland-2025"

abstract: >
  Reproducible analysis code for the study of Healthy Fitness Zone
  attainment among Polish schoolchildren in 2025. The repository
  contains the analytical pipeline used for data preparation, HFZ
  classification, age- and sex-specific analyses, regional
  standardisation, inverse-probability weighting, missing-not-at-random
  sensitivity analyses, and generation of reported outputs.
  Individual-level registry data are not included because they are
  subject to access and redistribution restrictions.
